INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771566145861', 'Rane one DJ Controller', 'The Rane one dj controller  is a premium, motorized DJ controller designed for a vinyl-like experience, offering a highly tactile and professional performance for scratch DJs and turntablists.

The ONE incorporates two 7.2″ motorized turntable platters for a traditional vinyl feeling, complete with customizable (low/high) torque settings. The unit provides an authentic, tactile control over your music and performance with the foundation art of DJing at its very core, including a traditional turntable plunger style start/stop button.

Other notable features include 8 multicolor velocity-sensitive performance pads per deck, each assignable to Hot Cues, Saved Loops, Roll, Sampler, Slicer, and Serato’s Scratch Bank feature. There are six radio-style FX buttons, which can be activated in any combination. Each channel offers a 3-band dynamic EQ and high/low pass filters, as well as dedicated loop controls.

Benefits
At a Glance
7.2″ motorized platters with quick-release acrylic disks
Trusted RANE build quality and feel
Instant access software FX with two metal FX paddles
Ultralight MAG FOUR crossfader
High/low-pass filter and 3-band EQ
Dedicated loop Controls
Independent multimode performance pads including Serato Scratch Banks
Turntable style start/stop
XLR main and booth outputs
Two line/phono inputs
Two TRS/XLR microphone inputs
Two USB computer connections
Portable DJ controller
Serato DJ Pro Included (paid upgrade to Serato DVS)
Control and Effects
Craft your sound with RANE ONE’s multifunction, independent performance pads, giving you access to Hot Cues, Saved Loops, Roll, Sampler, Slicer and Serato’s Scratch Bank feature. With six radio-style FX buttons, instantly activate any combination of software FX with a single press, fine-tune with depth and beat parameter controls, then activate with the independent aluminum paddle controls. Finally, take full control of your sound with the 3-band dynamic EQs and high-/low-pass filters on each deck along with dedicated loop controls.
Connections
Each deck is switchable between 2 USB laptop connections as well as a line input that’s switchable to phono for traditional turntables. Amplify your music through RANE’s pro audio circuitry to the balanced main & booth XLR outputs, and additional RCA main out. There are two dual TRS/XLR microphone inputs alongside an auxiliary input, giving you up to 5 sources of audio to mix.
Precision Cuts
The ONE’s crossfader features the latest MAG FOUR fader, RANE’s lightest and smoothest fader, ever. With front-panel controls for fast/slow contour adjustment, internal tension adjust, reverse switch, and a new to Serato software cut-in adjustment control, DJs will be able to get just the right feel they need for maximum performance.
Dedicated Loop
Featuring a dedicated loop section, the ONE allows DJ’s to loop section of a track at the touch of a button with double and half controls instantly accessible. Relooping and manual in/out controls are also available to ensure complete freedom in track and mix control.
